<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101126">
  <meta name="description" content="EduSmart, game kuis edukasi interaktif untuk pelajar SMA dan SMK.">
  <title>EduSmart — Kuis Pelajar</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="background-glow glow-one"></div>
  <div class="background-glow glow-two"></div>

  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="EduSmart Beranda">
      <span class="brand-icon">E</span>
      <span>Edu<span class="brand-accent">Smart</span></span>
    </a>
    <span class="header-tag">STUDENT QUIZ GAME</span>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> LEARN • PLAY • GROW</span>
      <h1>Uji kemampuanmu.<br><span>Raih skor terbaikmu.</span></h1>
      <p>Belajar jadi lebih seru melalui kuis interaktif untuk pelajar SMA/SMK.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="game-card" aria-label="Permainan kuis">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div>
          <span class="section-label">EDUSMART CHALLENGE</span>
          <h2 id="screenTitle">Siap untuk tantangan?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="round-badge">✦ QUIZ TIME</div>
      </div>

      <div id="startScreen" class="screen">
        <div class="welcome-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="art-circle">
            <span class="art-star star-a">✦</span>
            <span class="art-star star-b">✧</span>
            <span class="art-book">📚</span>
            <span class="art-pencil">✎</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3>Seberapa luas pengetahuanmu?</h3>
        <p class="screen-description">
          Jawab 10 pertanyaan pilihan ganda dari berbagai mata pelajaran.
          Setiap soal punya waktu 20 detik.
        </p>

        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-icon">◎</span>
            <span><strong>10 soal</strong><small>Kuis campuran</small></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-icon">◷</span>
            <span><strong>20 detik</strong><small>Per pertanyaan</small></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-icon">★</span>
            <span><strong>100 poin</strong><small>Per jawaban benar</small></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button id="startButton" class="primary-button">
          Mulai Bermain <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
        <p class="small-note">Gratis dimainkan • Tanpa perlu login</p>
      </div>

      <div id="quizScreen" class="screen hidden">
        <div class="quiz-meta">
          <span id="questionCounter">PERTANYAAN 1 DARI 10</span>
          <span class="score-pill">★ <span id="score">0</span> poin</span>
        </div>

        <div class="progress-track" role="progressbar"
             aria-label="Progres kuis" aria-valuemin="0"
             aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuenow="0" id="progressTrack">
          <div id="progressBar" class="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-meta">
          <span id="subjectTag" class="subject-tag">PENGETAHUAN UMUM</span>
          <div id="timerBox" class="timer-box">
            <span aria-hidden="true">◷</span>
            <span id="timer">20</span> detik
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 id="questionText" class="question-text">Pertanyaan akan muncul di sini.</h3>
        <div id="answerList" class="answer-list"></div>

        <div id="feedback" class="feedback hidden" aria-live="polite">
          <strong id="feedbackTitle"></strong>
          <p id="explanation"></p>
        </div>

        <button id="nextButton" class="primary-button hidden">
          Soal Berikutnya <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
        <p class="small-note">Pilih satu jawaban yang paling tepat.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="resultScreen" class="screen hidden">
        <div class="result-medal" aria-hidden="true">🏆</div>
        <span class="section-label">CHALLENGE SELESAI</span>
        <h3 id="resultTitle">Kerja bagus!</h3>
        <p id="resultMessage" class="screen-description"></p>

        <div class="final-score">
          <span>SKOR AKHIR</span>
          <strong id="finalScore">0</strong>
          <small>dari 1000 poin</small>
        </div>

        <div class="result-stats">
          <div><strong id="correctCount">0</strong><span>Benar</span></div>
          <div><strong id="wrongCount">0</strong><span>Salah / Terlewat</span></div>
          <div><strong id="accuracy">0%</strong><span>Akurasi</span></div>
        </div>

        <button id="restartButton" class="primary-button">
          <span aria-hidden="true">↻</span> Main Lagi
        </button>
        <p class="small-note">Terus belajar, terus berkembang!</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <span>© 2026 EduSmart</span>
      <span>Dibuat untuk semangat belajar ✦</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
